# Caddy config for the shared STAGING / pre-prod VPS (template of
# /opt/caddy/Caddyfile).
#
# The VPS runs one Caddy for several projects, so the server file is NOT a
# copy of this one: it holds the global options below, other projects' site
# blocks (e.g. magspace.sainet.pl) and the import line for MAGGuarantee. The
# MAGGuarantee site itself lives in sites/magguarantee.caddy and is read
# straight from the app checkout through the `sites` volume
# (docker-compose.yml) — edit it there, never in /opt/caddy.
#
# Fresh VPS: copy this file to /opt/caddy/Caddyfile and add other projects'
# site blocks below the import.
#
# Prod uses Caddyfile.prod instead (behind the corporate nginx, no ACME).

